{"type":"message","id":"4d1a297b","parentId":"8d9c3f1a","timestamp":"2026-03-10T07:18:53.966Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The exit code was 0, and there's no output. The `git diff --staged --quiet` would return 0 if there are NO changes (quiet means no output = success = no changes). Wait, actually let me check - `git diff --staged --quiet` returns 0 when there are NO differences, meaning no staged changes.\n\nSo there are no changes to commit. I should report this as \"no changes\" - which means nothing to sync.","thinkingSignature":"7e50e4c95cd0a2947dc88bbde6313e4010aeeda8b36a3991d66525f2112db0fb"},{"type":"text","text":"No changes to sync — the vault is already up to date."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.1","usage":{"input":351,"output":113,"cacheRead":15072,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15536,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773127129891}}
